# An unclosed `[` before `;`: DS0112 points at it; the next statement parses.
mode: syntax
---- query
'orders.csv' | extend x = tags[0;
'customers.csv' | count
---- expected
PROGRAM@0..58
  PIPELINE@0..32
    LITERAL@0..12
      STRING@0..12 "'orders.csv'"
    WHITESPACE@12..13 " "
    PIPE@13..14 "|"
    WHITESPACE@14..15 " "
    EXTEND_OP@15..32
      IDENT@15..21 "extend"
      WHITESPACE@21..22 " "
      NAMED_EXPR@22..32
        NAME@22..23
          IDENT@22..23 "x"
        WHITESPACE@23..24 " "
        EQ@24..25 "="
        WHITESPACE@25..26 " "
        INDEX_EXPR@26..32
          NAME_REF@26..30
            IDENT@26..30 "tags"
          L_BRACK@30..31 "["
          LITERAL@31..32
            LONG@31..32 "0"
  SEMICOLON@32..33 ";"
  WHITESPACE@33..34 "\n"
  PIPELINE@34..57
    LITERAL@34..49
      STRING@34..49 "'customers.csv'"
    WHITESPACE@49..50 " "
    PIPE@50..51 "|"
    WHITESPACE@51..52 " "
    COUNT_OP@52..57
      IDENT@52..57 "count"
  WHITESPACE@57..58 "\n"

error[DS0112]: unclosed `[`
  --> query:1:31
  |
1 | 'orders.csv' | extend x = tags[0;
  |                               ^ - expected `]` before this
  |                               |
  |                               this `[` is never closed
  |
  = help: add `]` where the bracketed part ends
